IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYROLL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-RATE  PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 25.00.
01 WS-HOURS PIC 9(3)    VALUE 160.
01 WS-GROSS PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TAX   PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-NET   PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM CALC-GROSS.
    PERFORM CALC-TAX.
    COMPUTE WS-NET = WS-GROSS - WS-TAX.
    DISPLAY "Gross: " WS-GROSS.
    DISPLAY "Tax:   " WS-TAX.
    DISPLAY "Net:   " WS-NET.
    IF WS-NET > 3000 THEN
        DISPLAY "Bracket: high"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "Bracket: low"
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

CALC-GROSS.
    COMPUTE WS-GROSS = WS-RATE * WS-HOURS.

CALC-TAX.
    COMPUTE WS-TAX = WS-GROSS * 0.18 ROUNDED.
